```
Kr=[0,1,1] is vector B, which is exactly the vector H27 requires Kr to hold (its unique "outcome=0" vector under p0 XNOR p2). This eliminates H20 (which needed Kr=[0,0,0]) and confirms H27 deterministically — verified consistent with all four sealed experiment results (Ly=0, Nd=1, Kr=0, Wt=1, Xp=1 all match p0 XNOR p2 exactly).

